@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
autonumber
title RetailFlow - UNKNOWN reconciliation and exact replay
actor Finance
participant "Reference HTTP API" as API
participant "Domain functions" as Domain
database "Embedded PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Mock outcome selector\n(same process)" as Mock
actor "Provider event fixture" as Provider
Finance -> API: POST /refunds + Idempotency-Key
API -> Domain: refund(input, key, actor)
Domain -> DB: BEGIN / validate actor, ACCEPTED return, key, units
alt key already matches operation / actor / payload
  DB --> Domain: original response
  Domain -> DB: COMMIT (no new instruction or attempt)
  Domain --> API: replayed = true / original IDs and response
  API --> Finance: HTTP 200
else first valid command
  Domain -> Mock: select explicit simulation outcome
  Mock --> Domain: UNKNOWN
  Domain -> DB: insert logical refund, attempt, key response, audit
  Domain -> DB: COMMIT
  Domain --> API: original IDs / UNKNOWN
  API --> Finance: HTTP 201
end
note over Finance, DB
  No retry while PENDING or UNKNOWN.
  A later exact replay still returns its original
  response; GET /workbench shows current status.
end note
Provider -> API: POST /payment-events (eventId, attemptId, providerRef, SUCCEEDED)
API -> Domain: paymentEvent(input, provider fixture)
Domain -> DB: BEGIN / validate provider role, reference, event ID
alt duplicate event with identical fingerprint
  Domain -> DB: read recorded disposition / COMMIT
  API --> Provider: HTTP 200 / replayed = true
else mismatched reference or reused event ID with changed data
  Domain -> DB: ROLLBACK
  API --> Provider: HTTP 409 / no state change
else valid confirmation on non-terminal attempt
  Domain -> DB: insert event / mark attempt and refund SUCCEEDED
  Domain -> DB: mark return COMPLETED / append audit / COMMIT
  API --> Provider: HTTP 200 / APPLIED
else event on terminal attempt
  Domain -> DB: record IGNORED_TERMINAL / audit / COMMIT
  API --> Provider: HTTP 200 / no state regression
end
note over API, Mock
  No bank/network call is implemented.
  Production outbox, provider signatures and durable
  recovery require a separate integration increment.
end note
@enduml
